---
layout: atlas
---
<div class="page-width inner-page blog-page">
  <header class="page-title">
    <h1>Blog<span class="title-dot">.</span></h1>
    <p>Notes on the process, unexpected detours, and life around research.</p>
  </header>
  {% if site.posts.size > 0 %}
    <div class="blog-grid">
      {% for post in site.posts %}
        <article class="blog-card">
          <a href="{{ post.url | relative_url }}">
            {% if post.image -%}
              <img class="blog-cover" src="{{ post.image | relative_url }}" alt="{{ post.image_alt | default: post.title | escape }}">
            {%- endif %}
            <div class="blog-card-copy">
              {% if post.topic %}
                <p class="eyebrow">{{ post.topic }}</p>
              {% endif %}
              <h2>{{ post.title }}</h2>
              <p>{{ post.description }}</p>
              <span class="blog-meta">
                {{- post.date | date: '%b %d, %Y' }}
                <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span
              >
            </div>
          </a>
        </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  {% else %}
    <div class="blog-empty">
      <h2>Between the papers.</h2>
      <div class="blog-empty-copy">
        <p>A space for the side stories: things I tried, questions that stayed with me, and what I learned along the way.</p>
        <p class="muted">The first story is still being written.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  {% endif %}
</div>
